<!--Post: 3736--><!--Time: 1105163423-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3736"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 07, 2005 - 9:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Gotcha, <BR> <BR>I really think he has more important things to do than worry about what the amateur Monday morning quarterbacks on this Board think one way or the other, you included. Someone has to speak up for a group that is quickly becoming the biggest scapegoats since the communists were blamed for the Reichstag fire. Lt. Landwehr is a little too busy a&#41; trying to catch BTK and b&#41; answering all of the incredibly dumb questions everyone can&#39;t seem to stop asking. LET HIM DO HIS JOB AND LET ME EXERCISE MY RIGHT TO SPEAK FREELY AND MIND YOUR OWN DAMN BUSINESS. I will defend and support the police any and every time I jolly well feel like it and it still won&#39;t be near enough compared to what they deserve from us.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3736-->
<!--Post: 3907--><!--Time: 1105410137-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3907"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Alobster7<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Alobster7<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 6:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I support cops also and believe they are underpaid and underappreciated.  Music that underrates them really makes me sick. <BR> <BR>HOWEVER...even Tom said in an earlier post that the WPD could reveal more artwork from the killer.  This is how the Unibomber was apprehended.  Personally, after 30 of this stuff, the police should probably change a lot of strategies.   <BR> <BR>A sizable publicized reward is still what I believe will bring someone &#40;especially a loyal dedicated relative&#41; to recognize BTK&#39;s writing and reveal some clues. <BR> <BR>This writer of the petition seems to detest the way BTK has committed so many &#34;in your face&#34; crimes without being caught.  I am amazed at the small area in which he has struck.  In addition, mailing all his trophies to the police.  I would be scared if I lived in Wichita. <BR> <BR>I read that after the Otero murdering took place, the police later spent the night in the home with a psychic.  Please! <BR> <BR>  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
